
% Drunk on You

In_1: IV |
a: IV | . I . . | V | . vi . . |
a_cad: IV | . I . . | V |
link: IV | . I . . | V |
In_2: $a $a_cad
outro: $a $a_cad
b: vi | . I . . | V | . I . . | vi | . IV . . |
Vr: $b*2
aa: IV | I | V | vi |
aa_cad: IV | I | V |
aa_turnaround: IV | V |
a_ch: $aa $aa_cad
Ch: $a_ch*2 $aa_turnaround
bridge: $a_ch $In_1*2
fadeout: IV |
S: [A] $In_1 $In_2 $Vr $Ch $link $Vr $Ch $bridge $Ch $outro $fadeout
